{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PictureInPictureCapable\/onPictureInPictureChange(_:)"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the single observer for presentation-mode changes. The handler"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when the window opens and "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when it closes,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whoever drove the transition. Installing replaces any previous handler."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onPictureInPictureChange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handler","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The adapter MUST also invoke the handler once, synchronously or on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next main-queue turn, with the CURRENT state at install time. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"adapter outlives the SDK session (one player, many sessions), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition that lands between sessions — the previous session’s window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closing late, the next one not yet initialized — is otherwise consumed"},{"t